Z||000000||firstfiero||07-21-2001||10:48 AM||||    Nothing real exciting. Just a late 90s vr6 Jetta with some rims. Kids thought they were pretty hot weaving in and out of traffic,screaching their tires. I managed to get up beside them and gave the v6 a few revs to see if they were willing. they definitly were so it was on. We take off at the light and it's not even close. I immediatly have a half car length on him right off the line and 3 quarters the way down the block it's about 2 car lengths without even really braking a sweat. I shut her down as I see the light is red and don't you know he goes flying by and comes screeching to a stop at the light. They're hollering something about beating me to the light and start reving like they wanted more. FINE BY ME...stupid kids didn't learn their lesson the first time. So this time at the light I red line first,2nd and blast through 3rd and completly killed him. When they pulled up next to me at the light I hollered off "hey what took you so long" ...they didn't seem to find that to ammusing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> anyway I turned their and headed home. It was my first race in about a month...gotta love the rush even if it is against a jetta.<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
