Z||000007||fiero56||07-22-2001||02:34 PM||||All of my friends all through school drove 4-cyl imports(honda, acura, toyota, infin, etc). They always thought their cars were the fastest things out there. Then, I would let them drive my '88 merc' Sable with a 3.0 and they said they didn't know what to do with all that power(I thought it was pretty slow). I think it works along the same lines as when you go 80mph for a while, and get off the highway and are stuck at 35, it feels sooooo slooowww. But before you got on the highway, 35 seemed kinda' quick. I can't rememeber the word for it, speed-something.||||reg||1
